  "title": "Cardinal Infrastructure Group Announces Acquisition of Piedmont Pipe Construction",
  "summary": "RALEIGH, N.C., June 2, 2026 /PRNewswire/ -- Cardinal Infrastructure Group, Inc., (Nasdaq: CDNL) (\"Cardinal\" or \"the Company\") announced the acquisition of Piedmont Pipe Construction, Inc., (\"Piedmont\"). Founded in 1999, Piedmont is a leading wet utilities provider across North and South Carolina.",
